# --- debugging, incidents, production -------------------------------------
диагност    diagnose debug investigate
сломал      diagnose debug broken failure
почему      diagnose debug
ошибк       diagnose debug error failure
падает      diagnose debug incident failure
упал        incident diagnose failure outage
инцидент    incident outage postmortem
авари       incident outage failure
логах       logs diagnose debug
# симптом в домене вместо слова «диагностируй» — 3 молчания на ad-hoc корпусе
уведомлен   notification diagnose incident debug
не публик   diagnose incident debug failure
не отправ   diagnose incident debug failure
не сработ   diagnose incident debug failure
не пришл    diagnose incident debug failure
stall       diagnose incident debug latency
# The four `не …` stems above are MULTI-WORD, which works only because skill-hint.sh splits the
# stem from its terms on a run of **2+ spaces** — align them with at least two spaces or the
# stem silently truncates to `не` and injects "diagnose incident debug failure" into any negated
# Russian prompt (measured 2026-08-03, before the parser was fixed).
логов       logs diagnose debug
продакш     production live deploy
проде       production live deploy
боев        production live trading
торгов      trading live production strategy
позиц       trading position live
бирж        exchange trading live

